  "task": {
    "source_message_id": 50,
    "speaker": "client",
    "text": "Hi,\n\nOnce the five amendments below are complete, I think the report will be ready for sign-off.\n\nThank you for sending the updated version. It is now much closer to what I wanted, and I am happy to retain the overall design direction. Another redesign is not needed; only a final tidy-up remains before approval.\n\nPlease make these final changes:\n\n1\\. Assessment date placeholder\n\nOn page one, replace the report’s current text:\n\n“Assessment Date: Assessment Date.”\n\nwith either:\n\n“Assessment Date: \\[Assessment Date\\]”\n\nor an editable date field that I can update for each customer.\n\n2\\. Typo correction\n\nThe wording on page 2 currently reads:\n\n“Owners often overrate gated drivers.”\n\nPlease correct it to:\n\n“Owners often overrate gated driveways.”\n\n3\\. Awkward sentence correction\n\nAlso on page 2, replace this sentence:\n\n“Assessment note: Storage is helping presentations slightly...”\n\nwith:\n\n“Assessment note: Storage slightly improves the vehicle’s security presentation, but not enough to offset the wider weaknesses in the setup.”\n\n4\\. Page 4 footer\n\nAlthough pages 1, 2 and 3 use a consistent footer, page 4 appears to be missing that same footer because of the distribution warning section. Please restore the standard footer on page 4 so it remains consistent throughout the full report.\n\n5\\. Final distribution warning section\n\nThe distribution warning works well, but at the bottom of page 4 it still feels slightly too dominant. Please reduce or refine it a little so that it stays clear and professional without overpowering the page or interfering with the footer.\n\nThanks"
  },
